{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p004804","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p004804"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p004804","label":"孟嘗君引述（呂不韋列傳候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"孟嘗君","mention_ids":["c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m009-0024"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m009-0024","chapter_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:p009","quote":"孟嘗君"}]}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m009-0024","start":24,"end":27,"surface":"孟嘗君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004804","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:p009","chapter_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji085-015","person_id":"cbr-p004804","scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-085-lubuwei"],"status":"contextual_provisional","rationale":"依子楚歸秦、孝文莊襄王序與太子政立王的句群暫接，子政母未補姓名，四公子並列不作同時在世證據；養母與真母、仲父號稱各分存。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","surfaces":["孟嘗君"],"evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:p009","quote":"當是時，魏有信陵君，楚有春申君，趙有平原君，齊有孟嘗君，皆下士喜賓客以相傾。呂不韋以秦之彊，羞不如，亦招致士，厚遇之，至食客三千人。是時諸侯多辯士，如荀卿之徒，著書布天下。呂不韋乃使其客人人著所聞，集論以為八覽、六論、十二紀，二十餘萬言。以為備天地萬物古今之事，號曰呂氏春秋。布咸陽市門，懸千金其上，延諸侯游士賓客有能增損一字者予千金。"}]}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:p009","text":"當是時，魏有信陵君，楚有春申君，趙有平原君，齊有孟嘗君，皆下士喜賓客以相傾。呂不韋以秦之彊，羞不如，亦招致士，厚遇之，至食客三千人。是時諸侯多辯士，如荀卿之徒，著書布天下。呂不韋乃使其客人人著所聞，集論以為八覽、六論、十二紀，二十餘萬言。以為備天地萬物古今之事，號曰呂氏春秋。布咸陽市門，懸千金其上，延諸侯游士賓客有能增損一字者予千金。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m009-0006","start":6,"end":9,"surface":"信陵君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004801","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m009-0012","start":12,"end":15,"surface":"春申君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004802","status":"contextual_provisio